  "status": "present",
  "value": "logs is a list of entries \"<processId>:<threadId>:<timestamp>:<content>\", split at the first three colons. For every distinct (processId, threadId) pair return one string \"<processId>:<threadId>:<count>:<first>:<last>\", where count is the number of its entries and first and last are its smallest and largest timestamps. Order the strings by processId, then threadId, in code-point order.",
